TI  - Influence of temperature on the relationship between oxygen- and fluorescence-based estimates of photosynthetic parameters in a marine benthic diatom (Cylindrotheca closterium)
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF PHYCOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - microphytobenthos
KW  - PAM fluorescence
