TI  - Coral bleaching occurrence and its relation to marine heatwave events in the Southwestern waters of South Sulawesi, Indonesia, as part of the Coral Triangle region
T2  - JOURNAL OF MARINE SYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - Marine heatwaves
