TI  - Six decades of global coral bleaching monitoring: a review of methods and call for enhanced standardization and coordination
T2  - FRONTIERS IN MARINE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - coral reefs
KW  - coral bleaching surveys
KW  - global bleaching review
KW  - marine heatwaves
