TI  - Successive stressors alter microbiome composition and reduce resilience in the eelgrass Zostera marina
T2  - MARINE ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Zostera marina
KW  - Seagrass microbiome
KW  - Multiple stressors
KW  - Nutrient enrichment
