TI  - Photo-physiology and morphology reveal divergent warming responses in northern and southern hemisphere seagrasses
T2  - MARINE BIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - POSIDONIA-OCEANICA
KW  - MEDITERRANEAN SEAGRASSES
KW  - CYMODOCEA-NODOSA
KW  - PHOTOSYNTHETIC RESPONSES
