TI  - Marine heat waves differentially affect functioning of native (Ostrea edulis) and invasive (Crassostrea [Magallana] gigas) oysters in tidal pools
T2  - MARINE ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Ecosystem functioning
