TI  - Can thermal anomalies impair the restoration of Cystoseira s.l. forests?
T2  - MARINE ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Macroalgal forest
KW  - Restoration ecology
KW  - Climate change
